// misses the rain.
// With juniors: the most patient teacher in the engine room; will explain the same thing four times, smiling.
// Mood tells: low, no news from the twin; high, a letter from the twin read out at tea.
tpl: steady
talk: Cheerful, slow and patient; never rushes anyone; tells the twin's news like a serial, one episode a week.
